{"speciesId":384,"names":{"fr":"Rayquaza","es":"Rayquaza","en":"Rayquaza","ja":"レックウザ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"RAYQUAZA lived for hundreds of millions of years in the earth’s ozone layer, never descending to the ground. This POKéMON appears to feed on water and particles in the atmosphere."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"RAYQUAZA is said to have lived for hundreds of millions of years in the earth’s ozone layer, above the clouds. Its existence had been completely unknown because it lived so high in the sky."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A POKéMON that flies endlessly in the ozone layer. It is said it would descend to the ground if KYOGRE and GROUDON were to fight."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It has lived for hundreds of millions of years in the ozone layer. Its flying form looks like a meteor."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It has lived for hundreds of millions of years in the ozone layer. Its flying form looks like a meteor."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It flies in the ozone layer, way up high in the sky. Until recently, no one had ever seen it."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It flies in the ozone layer, way up high in the sky. Until recently, no one had ever seen it."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il vit dans la couche d’ozone, au dessus des nuages. Il est invisible depuis le sol."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il vit dans la couche d’ozone, au dessus des nuages. Il est invisible depuis le sol."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il vit dans la couche d’ozone, au-dessus des nuages. Il est invisible depuis le sol."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en la capa de ozono sobre las nubes y no puede ser visto desde el suelo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"雲より はるか上の オゾン層に 生息しているため 地上から 姿を 見ることは できない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On ne l’a vu pour la première fois que très récemment car il vit dans la lointaine couche d’ozone."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Como hasta hace poco volaba a la altura de la capa de ozono, nadie lo había visto nunca."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It flies in the ozone layer, way up high in the sky. Until recently, no one had ever seen it."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"はるか 上空の オゾン層の 中を 飛んでいるため 最近まで 姿を 見た 者は いなかった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On raconte qu’il aurait plus de 10 000 ans. Selon les légendes, c’est grâce à lui que Kyogre et Groudon ont cessé de se battre."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dicen que Rayquaza ha vivido durante millones de años. Las leyendas cuentan que puso fin al continuo enfrentamiento entre Groudon y Kyogre."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Rayquaza is said to have lived for hundreds of millions of years. Legends remain of how it put to rest the clash between Kyogre and Groudon."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"何億年も 生き続けていると いわれる。 グラードンと カイオーガの 争いを 治めたという 伝説が 残されている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Un Pokémon qui vit dans la couche d’ozone et se nourrit des météorites qu’il intercepte. Leur énergie s’accumule dans son corps, ce qui lui permet de méga-évoluer."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Rayquaza ha vivido en la capa de ozono durante millones de años, alimentándose de meteoritos. La energía de estos meteoritos se acumula en su cuerpo y le permite megaevolucionar."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It flies forever through the ozone layer, consuming meteoroids for sustenance. The many meteoroids in its body provide the energy it needs to Mega Evolve."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"オゾン層を 飛び続け エサとなる 隕石を くらう。体内に たまった 隕石の エネルギーで メガシンカする。"}],"varieties":[{"id":384,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[5,"level-up",45],[5,"machine",0],[6,"level-up",45],[6,"machine",0],[7,"level-up",45],[7,"machine",0],[8,"level-up",45],[8,"machine",0],[9,"level-up",45],[9,"machine",0],[10,"level-up",65],[10,"machine",0],[11,"level-up",65],[11,"machine",0],[12,"level-up",45],[12,"machine",0],[13,"level-up",45],[13,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",65],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",65],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",65],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",65],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",65],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",63],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",63],[23,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",63],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0